Q: WAP to join first name and last name in string
package string_initialization;


public class String_initialization {

    
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String FirstName="Tony";
        String secondName="Stark";
        
       
        System.out.println("Full Name is = "+ FirstName+secondName);
    }
    
}

OUTPUT:

Full Name is = TonyStark
